"T_QUESTS_SCENARIO_INSANECHOICES_QUEST_HELP1_PART2" = "另一方面，这个小镇也确实需要一个新的面包店。决定权在您，大人。";
"T_QUESTS_SCENARIO_INSANECHOICES_QUEST_HELPER_TICKET" = "选择一项对策";
